                            {
                                "example_id": "8e31f72c-928f-4473-b335-bacc5e804595",
                                "sense_id": "1c443f7f-f437-302b-9994-9efb45df3896",
                                "text": "On sait que la division administrative de l’Égypte en douze nomes répondait à un panthéon de douze grands dieux et qu’Hérodote rapporte à l’Egypte l’origine du dodécathéisme grec.",
                                "translation": "We know that the administrative division of Egypt into twelve nomes corresponded to a pantheon of twelve great gods and that Herodotus reported the origin of Greek Dodekatheism to Egypt.",
                                "english": "We know that the administrative division of Egypt into twelve nomes corresponded to a pantheon of twelve great gods and that Herodotus reported the origin of Greek Dodekatheism to Egypt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32b35e24-89ad-46c6-bc96-859786bcda18",
                                "sense_id": "1c443f7f-f437-302b-9994-9efb45df3896",
                                "text": "Aussi appelé parfois dodécathéisme ou plus souvent néopaganisme hellénique) est la résurgence contemporaine de la religion grecque antique interdite par l’empereur Théodose en 392 et 393.",
                                "translation": "Also sometimes called Dodekatheism or more often Hellenic neopaganism) is the contemporary resurgence of the ancient Greek religion banned by Emperor Theodosius in 392 and 393.",
                                "english": "Also sometimes called Dodekatheism or more often Hellenic neopaganism) is the contemporary resurgence of the ancient Greek religion banned by Emperor Theodosius in 392 and 393."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b420952f-d283-4e77-9513-9300f4899309",
                                "sense_id": "1c443f7f-f437-302b-9994-9efb45df3896",
                                "text": "L’hellénisme, autrement appelé le « dodécathéisme » (culte des douze dieux de l’Olympe), semble, en effet, la forme de néopaganisme la plus présente chez les utilisateurs francophones de TikTok.",
                                "translation": "Hellenism, alternatively known as “Dodekatheism” (the worship of the twelve gods of Olympus), seems, in fact, to be the form of neopaganism most present among French-speaking TikTok users.",
                                "english": "Hellenism, alternatively known as “Dodekatheism” (the worship of the twelve gods of Olympus), seems, in fact, to be the form of neopaganism most present among French-speaking TikTok users."
                            }
                        ]
